{"seq":1,"slug":"the-republic","title":"共和制","docCount":2,"url":"/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"abolishing-the-sultanate","title":"废除苏丹制","url":"/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic/abolishing-the-sultanate","wordCount":1522,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-a-republic","title":"建立共和国","url":"/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic/building-a-republic","wordCount":1740,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 共和制\n\n确立共和制，是凯末尔缔造现代土耳其的根本变革。本章考察这一变革。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"废除苏丹制\"——他终结奥斯曼王朝、摧毁旧政治根基的果断抉择。第二篇文档讲述\"建立共和国\",呈现他以共和制取代君主专制、缔造现代国家。\n"}